00:06:07.410 --> 00:06:09.480
Could you highlight
any challenges

00:06:09.480 --> 00:06:12.030
that you faced as you
went through your journey

00:06:12.030 --> 00:06:13.650
from a technology point of view?

00:06:13.650 --> 00:06:14.400
RUSHABH VASA: Yes.

00:06:14.400 --> 00:06:16.990
There have been many
challenges, as you said rightly,

00:06:16.990 --> 00:06:20.550
but one major challenge became
when we started growing.

00:06:20.550 --> 00:06:23.580
We reached from 2 million
monthly streams to 6 million

00:06:23.580 --> 00:06:26.760
streams in just four months
and that traffic was coming

00:06:26.760 --> 00:06:28.210
from multiple end points.

00:06:28.210 --> 00:06:31.890
So it was difficult for us to
manage that kind of traffic

00:06:31.890 --> 00:06:33.760
because we were not
prepared for it.

00:06:33.760 --> 00:06:36.870
And that's where we used load
balancers and other techniques

00:06:36.870 --> 00:06:39.298
to solve this problem.

00:06:39.298 --> 00:06:40.090
ROMIN IRANI: Great.

00:06:40.090 --> 00:06:44.597
Now, you specifically mentioned
